---
/* The A9 comparison preview (founder G5, integration), preview only: the home with direction W4's
   story, Begegnung (encounter), in the story slot, at /__preview/home/begegnung. The page exists only in
   PUBLIC_PREVIEW_VARIANTS=1 builds: astro.config.mjs injects its route then and only then, so a
   production build does not even compile it (A8's /__preview/brand reaches the same with an empty
   getStaticPaths; here the stronger form keeps the direction's styles out of production too).
   Everything but the slot is the default home's (components/Home.astro); the story is the
   direction's own folder, unchanged (src/components/directions/begegnung/). */
import Home from '../components/Home.astro';
import Story from '../components/directions/begegnung/Story.astro';
---
<Home path="/__preview/home/begegnung" direction="begegnung" title="Linkbot preview: the home with the direction Begegnung (encounter)">
  <Story />
</Home>
